A role card shows the results expected and what the person can decide.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Give every area one accountable owner.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write spending limits and when to ask.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Include volunteers and elected officers.

6
