An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: Sari leads planting and safeguarding; any adult volunteer can stop an activity for safety.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create role cards for your essential roles.

9
